James received an email inquiry from Sumit Sarker, a prospective graduate student with a background in oceanography and climate impact analysis, seeking research opportunities under his supervision for Fall 2026. Sumit detailed his qualifications, research experience, and expressed interest in James’s work on climate change impacts and socioeconomic systems. James requested a professional email response addressing the inquiry. He informed Sumit that, unfortunately, there wouldn’t be any funding available for new students in his group for that year while inviting him to connect for potential future opportunities via a Zoom chat.
